    "detailed_description": "Pixel Punk is a strategy tower defence.<br />\r\nIn pixel Punk you build different turrets that will protect you against the never ending waves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Pixel Punk you will start off with just the basic generator and some coins to purchase your first turrets. The game will start directly when you join the game. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you start the game you will have a set amount of energy that you can spend. Use it wisely! Because when you are out of energy you will need to upgrade your generator or upgrade the turrets. <br />\r\nThe turrets in the game use different amounts of energy and that's why not all turrets are good to use in the start but great to use in the end. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe waves start easy but ramps up to harder faster enemies.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe strategy in the game is to know where and when to place different turrets and also know when it is time to upgrade the generator.",
